---
---

<section id="looks" aria-labelledby="looks-heading" class="page-grid pt-0">
  <div class="section-card">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <p class="accent-pill">Looks</p>
        <h2 id="looks-heading" class="headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl">
          Real people.
          <span class="block text-slate-300">Real Goodlife Hair.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="subheadline">
          Auf Instagram siehst du die aktuellsten Farben, Cuts und Transformationen.
          Hier bekommst du einen Vorgeschmack – im Feed passiert der Rest.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-xs text-xs text-slate-300 sm:mt-0">
        Ersetze diese Platzhalter-Kacheln später einfach mit echten Bildern aus eurem Feed
        oder einem Instagram-Embed.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/8 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-400/40 via-slate-900 to-slate-950" aria-hidden="true" />
      <div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/8 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-800 via-slate-950 to-fuchsia-500/30" aria-hidden="true" />
      <div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/8 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-400/25 via-slate-900 to-slate-950" aria-hidden="true" />
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
      <p>Mehr Looks, Farben & Transformationen findest du im Feed:</p>
      <a
        href="https://www.instagram.com/hairsalon.goodlife"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
        class="pill-link"
      >
        Instagram öffnen
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

